    "key": "C",
    "content": "Half of the minutes have more than 2.5 arrivals.",
    "rationale": "That describes a median, which E(X) need not equal."
   },
   {
    "key": "D",
    "content": "Over many minutes, arrivals average about 2.5 per minute.",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: E(X) is a long-run average."
   }
